<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 26px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 28px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 26px; line-height: 28px;">Sneak Peak of the Community Meetings</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">We have three Community Meetings coming up next month.&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">Join us for interactive and engaging sessions, where you can share your experiences and best practice with other community members. Part of these meetings will have a presentation from either Flywire, or an external speaker on an issue that will interest the audience.</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><strong>3rd July</strong> |&nbsp; International Payments Community Meeting</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><strong>8th July&nbsp;</strong> |&nbsp; AML Community Meeting</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><strong>10th July</strong>&nbsp; | &nbsp;Tribal Community Meeting</p> </td> 
</tr> 
